Z||000012||Cliff Pennock||04-11-99||03:24 AM||||Hi Bozone, and welcome! That is the very reason I created this Forum because those lists don't tolerate anything... I really don't mind the occasional off-topic post as long as it isn't offensive to anyone. There was a very funny discussion going on on the mailing list once about how to make a device to make your tires burn rubber. It was immediately shut down by the moderator because he found it not specific enough for Fiero's. That was when I first got the idea to start something of my own... Moderators tend to <b>over-moderate</b>. I will only remove messages or threads when enough other people ask me to do so. I mean, really, who am I to decide what people should discuss here?<p>For instance: as you may or may not know, my company makes digital dashboards for the Fiero, but if people wish to discuss my competitors digital dashboard here, so be it.
Z||000013||Motorhead||04-11-99||06:08 AM||||Thanks Cliff!<p>I'm not a "computer literate" person, my 19 year old son introduced the world of electronics into our home!<p>Right now I have an old system that I run CAD programs on for my own entertainment. <p>The 19 year old has me shopping for a system for the family however, and we'll soon catch up with the rest of the world.<p>I enjoy this chance to speak my mind here, whether appreciated or not, and look forward to participating in future discussions.<p>Thanks again!
